koz error : duplicate variable declaration in the same scope finkoz
keksoz age idon 21

koz error : unknown identifier, the variable was never declared finkoz
afise(vil)
keksoz total idon age èk bonus

koz error : unknown identifier, a variable cannot be used in its own declaration finkoz
keksoz konter idon konter èk 1

koz error : assignment to a variable that was never declared finkoz
pri idon 12.5

